sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client
    participant Server as Server Process
    participant WAL as Write-Ahead Log (disk)
    participant State as In-Memory State / Index

    Client->>Server: Write request (e.g. set balance = 100)
    Server->>WAL: Append record
    WAL->>WAL: fsync to disk
    Note over WAL: Durable now — survives a crash from this point on
    Server->>Client: Acknowledge commit
    Server->>State: Apply record to in-memory state
    Note over State: Rebuildable — replay the WAL to reconstruct this if lost

    rect rgb(255, 230, 230)
    Note over Server,State: Crash here, before apply, is safe:<br/>on restart, replay the WAL from the last checkpoint<br/>to rebuild State — the ack already matched durable data
    end
